, "end": 11.42, "text": "还许愿意", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 11.82, "end": 13.82, "text": "你以为你是大婚人家的小姐", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 14.3, "end": 15.78, "text": "那还是你女龙啊", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 19.78, "end": 21.42, "text": "这日子没法过了", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 22.14, "end": 23.78, "text": "打了十几年的仗", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 24.02, "end": 25.54, "text": "最后闹个财方", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 26.02, "end": 27.02, "text": "倒没啊", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 27.42, "end": 28.98, "text": "别长许短谈的了", "logprob": -0.5978762709668705}, {"start": 29.98, "end": 30.7, "text": "雷医生", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 30.9, "end": 34.7, "text": "送你个礼物呀", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 36.56, "end": 37.36, "text": "礼物", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 37.72, "end": 38.76, "text": "穷小子一个", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 38.76, "end": 39.84, "text": "能有啥礼物", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 40.12, "end": 40.96, "text": "我努力", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 41.56, "end": 43.32, "text": "你小子可别不识抬举", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 43.64, "end": 44.92, "text": "我这可是重点", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 45.6, "end": 47.32, "text": "本来想自己留着的", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 48.44, "end": 49.52, "text": "可是我瞧见老湛", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 49.52, "end": 51.52, "text": "有没撤职我的心里难受", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 51.76, "end": 53.04, "text": "你咬牙一剁脚", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 53.64, "end": 54.52, "text": "送你吧", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 55.84, "end": 56.68, "text": "我猜着了", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 56.88, "end": 58.4, "text": "你搞到了一只好枪", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 58.84, "end": 59.36, "text": "拿出来", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}, {"start": 59.36, "end": 60.24, "text": "请老子看看", "logprob": -0.526214711209561}], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0000_g0001": [], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0009_g0010": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.84, "text": "给我装", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 0.84, "end": 2.4, "text": "二百件一件不能少", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 3.16, "end": 4.44, "text": "我说的嘛", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 4.44, "end": 6.12, "text": "这厂长我不能白干", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 6.12, "end": 7.08, "text": "快装 快装", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 19.48, "end": 20.28, "text": "看见了啊", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 21.04, "end": 22.8, "text": "重担功威全在领事", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 25.08, "end": 26.6, "text": "反正我现在跟你说什么", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 26.6, "end": 27.4, "text": "你都不信", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 28.0, "end": 30.36, "text": "这批鬼子跟以前的鬼子不一样", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 31.56, "end": 32.76, "text": "不声不响的不说", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 32.76, "end": 34.12, "text": "枪还打得贼准", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 34.12, "end": 34.92, "text": "三个人一嘴", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 34.92, "end": 36.16, "text": "全部自动火气", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 37.12, "end": 38.48, "text": "从断崖那边摸上来", "logprob": -0.3347996447397315}, {"start": 38.96, "end": 40.44, "text": "咱们的公事", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 40.44, "end": 41.92, "text": "一律靠前修住", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 41.92, "end": 43.64, "text": "根本不起作用", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 43.64, "end": 44.76, "text": "人家打完了就走", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 44.76, "end": 46.0, "text": "也不跟你纠缠", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 46.0, "end": 47.6, "text": "让你拼刺刀都找不着人", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 49.88, "end": 51.0, "text": "我孔杰这辈子", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 51.0, "end": 52.6, "text": "没丢过这么大的脸", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 52.6, "end": 53.68, "text": "真能拿鞋门", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 55.72, "end": 58.56, "text": "你老兄是不是得吓破他了", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}, {"start": 58.56, "end": 59.68, "text": "我听你说了一遍", "logprob": -0.28290405466749863}], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0053": [], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0064": [], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0073_g0074": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.96, "text": "跳出来个赵", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 2.12, "end": 4.28, "text": "有个重要情报向你通报", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 4.44, "end": 4.92, "text": "屁", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 5.28, "end": 6.6, "text": "能有什么重要情报", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 8.92, "end": 9.6, "text": "你呀", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 10.44, "end": 11.4, "text": "还别不服气", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 11.84, "end": 12.96, "text": "上级派他来", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 12.96, "end": 14.4, "text": "自然有派他来的道理", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 14.76, "end": 16.76, "text": "你抖大字字不十几个", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 17.4, "end": 19.88, "text": "是该有个人好好教教你喽", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 20.04, "end": 21.44, "text": "不十几个自杂了", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 22.28, "end": 24.04, "text": "我干了这么多年的团长", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 24.4, "end": 25.6, "text": "也没见比谁差", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 26.36, "end": 27.6, "text": "尤其比你强", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 27.76, "end": 28.4, "text": "是啊", "logprob": -0.31775329849033646}, {"start": 29.16, "end": 30.4, "text": "我认倒没呀", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 31.96, "end": 33.84, "text": "可是你比我强到哪儿去了", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 34.24, "end": 36.4, "text": "你那新一团刚刚搞起来", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 36.72, "end": 37.88, "text": "战斗力上来了", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 38.12, "end": 39.28, "text": "装备也好了", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 39.88, "end": 40.44, "text": "得", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 41.08, "end": 42.4, "text": "不没你什么事了吗", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 43.52, "end": 45.8, "text": "人家丁伟来了就想现成的", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 46.4, "end": 47.76, "text": "你有气也没用", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 48.2, "end": 50.44, "text": "这呀 叫一抱怀一抱", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 56.65, "end": 58.81, "text": "你不提丁伟我还忘了", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}, {"start": 59.33, "end": 60.17, "text": "他还送给", "logprob": -0.2912536926891493}], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0087_g0088": [], "bili_liangjian_ep02_g0089": []}